sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Organizer
    participant P2 as Invitations API
    participant P3 as Wallet
    participant P4 as Outbox/RabbitMQ
    participant P5 as Rendering worker
    participant P6 as MinIO
    P1->>P2: Create batch
    P2->>P3: Reserve credits once
    P3->>P4: Commit batch / outbox
    P4->>P5: Render PDF items
    P5->>P6: Store private outputs
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
